(7336673, 1145943, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sure the connectors are the focus, but the rest of the image beautifully provides an interesting context.  The diagonals and the forward motion of the pedestrian bring a musical sense of composition into play.  The tight focus on the connectors is just right.  The sparkling water is joyful.  What I admire artistically is how the focused grittiness of the metal is complemented by the overall graininess of the rest of the picture.  Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Sure the connectors are the focus, but the rest of the image beautifully provides an interesting context.  The diagonals and the forward motion of the pedestrian bring a musical sense of composition into play.  The tight focus on the connectors is just right.  The sparkling water is joyful.  What I admire artistically is how the focused grittiness of the metal is complemented by the overall graininess of the rest of the picture.  Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2015-04-02 11:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7336684, 1145462, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clean, strong composition.  There certainly is a visceral sense of tension here.  The background sky is perfect.</td>', 'Clean, strong composition.  There certainly is a visceral sense of tension here.  The background sky is perfect.', '2015-04-02 11:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7336685, 1145852, 173844, '<td valign="top">Graphically interesting and nicely composed.  I like the subtle repetitions of line and the strong contrast.</td>', 'Graphically interesting and nicely composed.  I like the subtle repetitions of line and the strong contrast.', '2015-04-02 11:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7336688, 1145721, 173844, '<td valign="top">Having worked in shops myself, my initial focus was on the condition of the set up and wondering how it got to this neglected pass.  And why there was a drill chuck in the clamp.  When I pulled back from superficial evaluation, though, I could discern a beautifully balanced composition that actually startled me.  Bravo!</td>', 'Having worked in shops myself, my initial focus was on the condition of the set up and wondering how it got to this neglected pass.  And why there was a drill chuck in the clamp.  When I pulled back from superficial evaluation, though, I could discern a beautifully balanced composition that actually startled me.  Bravo!', '2015-04-02 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7336692, 1145395, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely done black and white.  The beautiful shapes and reflections in the water introduce a dreaminess to this otherwise highly realistic observation.  Is it all but a dream?</td>', 'Nicely done black and white.  The beautiful shapes and reflections in the water introduce a dreaminess to this otherwise highly realistic observation.  Is it all but a dream?', '2015-04-02 12:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7336693, 1145783, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice realization of a clever idea.  Our fate as quasi-robots seems inevitable.</td>', 'Nice realization of a clever idea.  Our fate as quasi-robots seems inevitable.', '2015-04-02 12:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
