(7337381, 1145901, 173844, '<td valign="top">An "everyday" view crafted into something that the viewer must address with renewed attention, sensitivity and humility.  I love the color, focus and grain.  I guess you spiraled the clothespins into position, which I wonder if necessary, but it does add liveliness and even a stylized sense of the wind.  Highly satisfying.</td>', 'An "everyday" view crafted into something that the viewer must address with renewed attention, sensitivity and humility.  I love the color, focus and grain.  I guess you spiraled the clothespins into position, which I wonder if necessary, but it does add liveliness and even a stylized sense of the wind.  Highly satisfying.', '2015-04-03 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7337382, 1145800, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very fine image.  It seems to be two moods dwelling happily as one.  First there are the muted blues and browns of the riverside scene, and then there are the bright kerchief and the colorful dots of light.  So, nice.  I''ve gone back and forth about the orange kerchief.  On the one hand it seems, to me, discordant.  On the other hand its translucency brings the water through quite beautifully.  The latter prevails.</td>', 'Very fine image.  It seems to be two moods dwelling happily as one.  First there are the muted blues and browns of the riverside scene, and then there are the bright kerchief and the colorful dots of light.  So, nice.  I''ve gone back and forth about the orange kerchief.  On the one hand it seems, to me, discordant.  On the other hand its translucency brings the water through quite beautifully.  The latter prevails.', '2015-04-03 18:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7337383, 1145790, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this image because it''s idiosyncratic and so cleverly employs clothespins.  I''ve also enjoyed pondering your choices of leaves for the various stages of human life.  Are they all from the same tree?  Nice idea.</td>', 'I like this image because it''s idiosyncratic and so cleverly employs clothespins.  I''ve also enjoyed pondering your choices of leaves for the various stages of human life.  Are they all from the same tree?  Nice idea.', '2015-04-03 18:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
